  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Texas A&M University-Corpus Christi (TAMU-CC) is a public research university located on Ward Island in Corpus Christi, Texas. Founded in 1947 and known as 'The Island University' — it is the only US university located on its own island. Since joining the Texas A&M University System in 1989, TAMU-CC has grown into an R2 Doctoral University with High Research Activity, serving over 10,000 students across six colleges and the School of Arts, Media, and Communication.",
      "The university is particularly distinguished for marine science and coastal studies through the Harte Research Institute for Gulf of Mexico Studies, with PhD programs in Marine Biology and Coastal and Marine System Science attracting researchers from across the world. The College of Business holds AACSB accreditation, and the College of Engineering and Computer Science offers strong programs in mechanical, electrical, and computer engineering.",
      "TAMU-CC offers 33 undergraduate majors, 25 graduate programs, and six doctoral programs. Notable strengths include Marine Biology, Environmental Science, Nursing, Geographic Information Science, and Mechatronics Engineering. The university is designated a Hispanic-Serving Institution and a Minority-Serving Institution.",
      "International students join from over 50 countries. Pathways include direct admission to undergraduate and graduate programs, plus the English Language Program for students needing additional language preparation. Corpus Christi offers a coastal-Texas lifestyle with beaches, sailing, and year-round mild weather on the Gulf Coast."
    ],
    "paragraphsRu": [
      "Texas A&M University-Corpus Christi (TAMU-CC) — государственный исследовательский университет на острове Ward Island в Корпус-Кристи, штат Техас. Основан в 1947 году; известен как «The Island University» — единственный университет США, расположенный на собственном острове. С 1989 года входит в Texas A&M University System и имеет статус R2 Doctoral University with High Research Activity. Более 10 000 студентов обучаются в шести колледжах и School of Arts, Media, and Communication.",
      "Университет особенно силён в marine science и coastal studies — благодаря Harte Research Institute for Gulf of Mexico Studies. PhD-программы Marine Biology и Coastal and Marine System Science привлекают исследователей со всего мира. College of Business имеет аккредитацию AACSB, а College of Engineering and Computer Science предлагает сильные программы по mechanical, electrical и computer engineering.",
      "TAMU-CC предлагает 33 бакалаврских направления, 25 магистерских и 6 PhD-программ. Сильные стороны: Marine Biology, Environmental Science, Nursing, Geographic Information Science, Mechatronics Engineering. Университет — Hispanic-Serving Institution и Minority-Serving Institution.",
      "Международные студенты приезжают из более чем 50 стран. Pathways: прямое поступление на бакалавриат и магистратуру, а также English Language Program для тех, кому нужна дополнительная языковая подготовка. Корпус-Кристи предлагает coastal-Texas lifestyle: пляжи, парусный спорт и мягкий климат на Gulf Coast круглый год."
